* Node Definitions
* 1 - V input for M1
* 2 - Positive terminal of VX
* 3 - V input for M2
* 4 - Negative terminal of VX
* 5 - Node P (Common source of M1 and M2)
* 6 - Drain of M2
* 7 - Drain of M1
* 8 - Positive terminal of V1
